## Architecture assessment

The candidate-neutral Core boundaries, DNS-only UDP dispatcher, exact accepted manifest pin, absent-vs-unreadable distinction, and separate session `activateReads` method fit the intended architecture. The revision is not acceptable until the production root owns the mandatory SSH composition and exact production/harness lifecycle evidence replaces the current fake-only proof.

